 - **An agent's right-click menu** in the `agents` list: compact, start over
   (`/clear` or `/new`), stop (`hc interrupt`, while it works), continue,
   pin, close. Typed commands go only to an agent that waits (idle or done).
+  Compact while it works is queued and typed in once its turn ends; one per
+  agent until it finishes, in shared `"compact/<address>"`:
+  `{ state: "queued" | "sent", at, text, sent?, turn? }` (null when none). A
+  mod with its own compact button sets and honors the same key, so pressing
+  in both is still one compact.
   Another mod adds items with shared `"agents.menu"`:
   `{ <mod>: { at, items: [{ id, label }] } }` (`at` in ms; entries older than
   10 minutes are left out, so say it again now and then). Picking one focuses
